    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p>Now if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>9</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is numerically greatest term, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo>&#8805;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>8</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>9</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mo>&#8804;</mo><munder><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>18</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mn>36</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>72</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>27</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>29</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmulti